        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-12T13:10:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In a recent game as Fanatic, when nobody had any cards, Blade had a Force Field, and both Traffic Pileup and Hostage Situation were in play, I took myself out with Exorcism, reasoning that my Incapacitated abilities would be more helpful at that point. &nbsp;They were, too!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I love situations like these, where counterintuitive plays pay off big.</p>",
